Source:    https://github.com/esp-rs/esp-pacs, esp32s31/svd/esp32s31.base.svd
Copyright: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) PTE LTD
License:   Apache-2.0

- registers/esp32s31/upstream/platform-radio-deps.svd: a subset with review
