3. Espressif vendor libraries
-----------------------------

Sources:   https://github.com/espressif/esp-phy-lib at 20f1db05,
           https://github.com/espressif/esp32-wifi-lib at af55a0ca,
           https://github.com/espressif/esp-coex-lib at c758e7b5
Copyright: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co Ltd
License:   Apache-2.0 (each repository's LICENSE)

Recovered tables and coefficients (coexistence schemes and PTI, PHY gain and
power, Wi-Fi) in production source; the SOURCE line beside each names the
library, object and symbol.


4. esp32s31-bt-lib
------------------

Source:    https://github.com/espressif/esp32s31-bt-lib at 10c50778
License:   none; facts only

The library has no license. The repository records only facts from it:
values, layouts, addresses, order of operations and names (the HAL and PAC,
knowledge/esp32s31/bluetooth, knowledge/esp32s31/notes and the name maps
under knowledge/esp32s31/vendor/facts/names). It records neither code nor
verbatim data blocks.


